  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into small chunks. Cut zucchini and carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and garlic & herb seasoning, and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, slice haloumi into 1cm-slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.\n• In a small bowl, a drizzle of olive oil and green dressing. Season, then set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/641a9297e88e2ff1a307b05c/step-d563f174.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, combine the water and vegetable stock powder.\n• Bring to the boil, then add couscous. Stir to combine, then cover with a lid and remove from heat. Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 minutes.\n• Fluff couscous up with a fork. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/641a9297e88e2ff1a307b05c/step-759b5fb2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. In a second small bowl, mix honey, sesame seeds and dried oregano.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi, in batches, until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove frying pan from heat. Add the honey mixture, turning haloumi to coat. Set aside.\n• To the couscous pan, add roasted veggies, the salad leaves and the dressing mixture. Gently toss to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/641a9297e88e2ff1a307b05c/step-bdb1e75f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roasted veggie couscous between bowls.\n• Top with honey-sesame herbed haloumi, spooning over any extra glaze from the pan.\n• Serve with a dollop of garlic sauce. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/641a9297e88e2ff1a307b05c/step-d27d8ec2.jpg"
    }
  ]
